                                        "entry_id": "d847b669-0c12-3481-9d83-1a9d95e1e749",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of burner phone, a mobile phone used for only a short time and then thrown away so that the owner cannot be traced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
