                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b51feec7-4167-35d4-9b33-1a8f7f8ca909",
                                        "entry_id": "d847b669-0c12-3481-9d83-1a9d95e1e749",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of coal burner (“a nonblack person, usually a woman, who has sexual relationships with black people, usually men”)."
